<title>FRANCE: RUGBY UNION-EUROPEAN CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-EUROPEAN CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BRIVE, France 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a European Cup rugby union quarter-final on Sunday:</p>
<p>Brive (France) 35 Llanelli (Wales) 14 (halftime 26-7)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Brive - Tries: Thierry Labrousse, David Venditti. Con: Christophe Lamaison (2). Penalties: Lamaison (7)</p>
<p>Llanelli - Tries: Ieuan Evans (2). Cons: Frano Botica (2).</p>
</text>
